    ('What does unittest.mock.PropertyMock() do?', '`unittest.mock.PropertyMock()`: A mock intended to be used as a property, or other descriptor, on a class. `PropertyMock` provides `__get__` and `__set__` methods so you can specify a return value when it is fetched.'),
